  "description": "DinkToPdf's API (namespace DinkToPdf: SynchronizedConverter, PdfTools, HtmlToPdfDocument, every setting), on marqius-wkhtmltopdf, the maintained drop-in replacement for wkhtmltopdf. Replace the DinkToPdf package with this one and delete libwkhtmltox: your code stays as it is. No native library to load, so no \"Unable to load shared library 'libwkhtmltox'\" and no BadImageFormatException; each PDF is made in its own process, so conversions run side by side. Windows, Linux (Alpine too) and macOS. marqius-wkhtmltopdf is commercial, with a 30-day free trial; free for personal, teaching and open-source use.",
